        <li class="fo-apply__item" style="animation-delay:.08s"><span class="fo-apply__check"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><path d="M2.5 7l3.5 3.5 5.5-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>Finance teams using TallyPrime</li>
        <li class="fo-apply__item" style="animation-delay:.16s"><span class="fo-apply__check"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><path d="M2.5 7l3.5 3.5 5.5-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>Accountants handling daily bank reconciliation</li>
        <li class="fo-apply__item" style="animation-delay:.24s"><span class="fo-apply__check"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><path d="M2.5 7l3.5 3.5 5.5-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>Businesses with multiple customer and vendor ledgers</li>
        <li class="fo-apply__item" style="animation-delay:.32s"><span class="fo-apply__check"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><path d="M2.5 7l3.5 3.5 5.5-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>Teams that require approval before posting</li>
        <li class="fo-apply__item" style="animation-delay:.40s"><span class="fo-apply__check"><svg viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none"><path d="M2.5 7l3.5 3.5 5.5-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></span>Operations with recurring receipt and payment matching</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
